Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Documents Management|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Document
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description1|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	Then DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentSize|0KB|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|

Scenario: Add Folder
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMFolder add CP
		|dmFolderDescription|DM Folder Description|
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	Then DMFolder view CP
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|

Scenario: Add Shortcut To Site Document
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteType|Blank|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Liferay|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add DM Shortcut CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	Then DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentSize|0KB|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|

Scenario: Edit Document
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentSize|0KB|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument edit CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description1|
		|dmDocumentDescriptionEdit|DM Document Description Edit|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
		|dmDocumentTitleEdit|DM Document Title Edit|
	Then DMDocument view Edit CP
		|dmDocumentTitleEdit|DM Document Title Edit|

