Scenario: Rotate Image Via DM Site Admin
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_2.jpg|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_2.jpg|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And AssertVisible the value 'Documents and Media' at locator 'ControlMenu#HEADER_TITLE'
	And ImageEditor goto Image Editor Via DM
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_2.jpg|
	And ImageEditor rotate Image
		|rotateDirection|left|
	And Pause at locator '3000'
	And ImageEditor apply Changes And Save File
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_2.jpg|
	Then DMDocument view Document Version Number Cmd PG
		|dmDocumentVersionNumber|1.1|

Scenario: Search For Document In Home Folder
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument search CP
		|dmDocumentKeyword|DM Document Title|
	Then DMDocument view Search Results CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|

Scenario: View Image Editor Controls
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|quarantine|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.jpg|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.jpg|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And ImageEditor goto Image Editor Via DM
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.jpg|
	Then ImageEditor view Base Controls